          "$a = \\dfrac{f(x_2) - f(x_1)}{x_2 - x_1}$",
          "$a = \\dfrac{5 - (-3)}{4 - 0}$",
          "$a = \\dfrac{8}{4}$",
          "$a = 2$"
        ],
